      "text": "A Patch track is used to control an associated patch by sending it start and stop messages. A Patch Track can have an audio output or other outputs that you can connect to different modules.\n \nTo Do:\n* Click the edit button see what is inside the patch for this track. \n* Double click an empty area in the patch track to add a new patch region. \n* You can drag your region back and forth by dragging the top header of the region. Multiple regions on a track share the same patch.\n* You can change the duration of the region by grabbing the bottom right corner and moving it left or right. ",
